{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "56570db2d0d31626ae21b660cf242a494f305d5ecb2ef9ee9a254a0233ff32cc", "ja": "ビギニング★パーティー", "zh": "起始★派对", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b03f5d1023fc6c60b3da7362c46b001bf85ab0c11af2e455a6d26bbe66213de5", "ja": "ハロウィンイベントのアンバサダーに選ばれ\nた茜と麗花。プロデューサーが席を外すと同\n時に調子に乗り始める茜だったが、律子が現\nれて抑え込まれてしまう。こうして、不思議\nなハロウィンが幕を開けた……。", "zh": "被选为万圣节活动大使的茜和丽花。制作人一离开座位，茜就开始得意忘形，但律子出现后将她制住了。就这样，奇妙的万圣节拉开了帷幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c4d60a2ae263510c8187f1019a1a36c847b024b89ad2756e03296f0e21c10b4f", "ja": "（ハロウィンのイベントには、アンバサダーの\n茜と麗花以外に、風花と莉緒も参加する事になった）", "zh": "（除了担任大使的茜和丽花之外，风花和莉绪也决定参加万圣节活动了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "471d0bd9e057dddd8e6869156b1eb7a4ad9bcf4fdd2d6a2694b911884cb5c259", "ja": "というわけで、茜と麗花にはハロウィンイベントの\nアンバサダーになってもらう事になった。", "zh": "所以，决定请茜和丽花担任万圣节活动的大使。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "21c9b04dd30cd3883a76430007c31ee41e12bc328f52b6fff50d025997c27056", "ja": "アンバサダー？", "zh": "形象大使？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "21c9b04dd30cd3883a76430007c31ee41e12bc328f52b6fff50d025997c27056", "ja": "アンバサダー？", "zh": "形象大使？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0dc417192fa07f6f6412d3b6bccf0e53a972a8090931f669ccdb1b6fdc5e1c57", "ja": "アンバサダー……たしか、「大使」っていう\n意味でしたっけ？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "大使……我记得是指“大使”，对吧？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "76d84cabdbd4ac0f73046c225497fe96f02e477ee9133ff01363e93eb66e761f", "ja": "そうだな。今回はお客さん目線で、イベントの見所や\n楽しみ方を発信する広告塔……みたいな意味かな。", "zh": "是啊。这次大概是指站在客人的角度，向大家介绍活动看点和享受方式的宣传大使……之类的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ca0d9d7dccc626ccfbf142b9ca57206394a64149eeebcd89cba67dd1e3b58be1", "ja": "アンバサダーのふたりには、ユニットを組んでもらう。\nCM撮影も予定されているから、しっかり頼んだぞ！", "zh": "两位大使要组成一个组合。\n还安排了广告拍摄，可要好好加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "dc1be72510bfad2ee723159776529d6fa3c34ce8c61ee35bd512308b19b2c827", "ja": "はいっ♪（は～い！）", "zh": "好♪（好——！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "186dad6559a03b5bcf645c5ac0eaac5fe03e35d465d1d9c2c4587467ffe8aba3", "ja": "そして風花と莉緒は、当日のイベント出演と、\n色々サポートを頼みたい。よろしくな！", "zh": "另外，风花和莉绪就拜托你们参加当天的活动，并提供各种支持了。拜托！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "25c0ccf13909280c5c7381de632d3654e1cc873a7780b5e54d0ebd1ad6acf3ec", "ja": "はいっ、まかせてください！", "zh": "好的！请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "2d458ff669c3b7ea3873d228abd3a074deaebcd31e4a3893988070c59da379c2", "ja": "茜ちゃんと麗花ちゃんのユニット、\nハロウィンにぴったりじゃないかしら。楽しみね♪", "zh": "小茜和丽花的组合，\n不是很适合万圣节嘛。真期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "bca160a6bb64b081abdca1d0f89b40d1d1506e30cf740a083525a7fba3209590", "ja": "わーい！　風花さん、莉緒さん、\nイベントがんばりましょうね♪", "zh": "好耶！风花小姐、莉绪小姐，\n活动要一起加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "f27d659b844360f82e9b93ba4f23ab964693de46be609447aa135db2c5e74a97", "ja": "莉緒やんと風花ちゃんの意見もしっかり聞いて、\n茜ちゃんはアンバサダーを務めてみせるよ！", "zh": "我会好好听莉緒和风花的意见，\n小茜一定会当好大使的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "af425cc9e72e3efec284a745a29526ddf35ffc5bdddaad9c7aa56328c6e5b101", "ja": "いい心がけだな！　何かあったらフォローするから、\n麗花と茜は、自由に取り組んでみてほしい。", "zh": "态度不错！要是有什么事，我会帮你们撑腰的，\n丽花和茜就放手去做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1c13231ef974ef0185c7e9b21b3f67b2c46263a037fc5880ccbc77c2711f435f", "ja": "主催も、ふたりのアイディアには\n大いに期待してるそうだ！", "zh": "听说主办方也非常期待你们两人的创意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "d2070895654fed3b24bf9f83ee32fdc9d9d44c4e598bdc8e9bffe0ef79e42b22", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか？　じゃあハロウィンと一緒に、\nお正月とクリスマスと山の日も祝っちゃいませんか！", "zh": "哇，真的吗？那不如把万圣节、\n新年、圣诞节和山之日放在一起庆祝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "43d724ce1a1e99cb6baa3083f5888a186f3dd77925cb511a6004a02921076e61", "ja": "麗花ちゃん、そこはハロウィン限定で！\nお客さん混乱しちゃうから！", "zh": "丽花，那部分只限定万圣节！会把观众搞糊涂的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9a32d6f4fbeb8c3279450181de11c3fabad4e885988e4368b541e7775babb2ab", "ja": "おっと、もうこんな時間か。打ち合わせがあるから\n出かけるけど、みんな、明日からよろしくな！", "zh": "哎呀，已经这个时间了啊。因为还有个会议\n我先出门了，大家，明天开始也拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "2ca970e960aa9974504eab4cba96068ec9e05743d6cdb6969a86a1f0b930082f", "ja": "はいっ、わかりました！\nいってらっしゃい、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "好的，明白了！\n路上小心，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "8bb21a4b9f19998411e2f8781b0a48e15dc739c3a4382bb8af2d2c818486520a", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、いってらっしゃ～い！\nお土産は、プリンでいいよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，路上小心～！\n伴手礼带布丁就可以啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1021_null", "source_sha256": "2e63bba24a33959cc8450a791941977259476309b8a28d2b83cc42baa1b8df2f", "ja": "ガチャ、バタン……", "zh": "咔嗒、砰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "427a4d8625521744e497918d1c49ebb470b4d9b5ff7984282b5891ac38c63a3c", "ja": "ふっふっふ……。\nニャーッハッハッハ！", "zh": "呵呵呵……。\n喵哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4c78c5140089fe6e6ddf5ff0e121898aec878527d4136b6214efd389bc534e6f", "ja": "え？　……あ、茜ちゃん？", "zh": "诶？……啊，小茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "1b2ea3d03fc844f03135e43cd59a61280bfa937c6c83cc5aa7d39dfa2dcc3054", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんさえいなければ、\nあとはこっちのモノ！　みんな、作戦会議するよ！", "zh": "只要没有{$P$}，\n剩下的就尽在掌握了！大家，来开作战会议吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "63321bd0ab440767de400000ee41e52e0707c14dc9bf102de10f9d049d340b24", "ja": "茜ちゃんと麗花ちゃんがメインの企画……\nこんな絶好のビジネスチャンス、逃す手はないよね♪", "zh": "以小茜和丽花为主角的企划……这么好的商机，当然不能放过啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "73b95cf8889deba52ad816278c0d34cc0f9fbe2f7d8ecb7063da25ef90388228", "ja": "ああっ、さっそく茜ちゃんが暴走しかけて！？\n莉緒さん、どうしましょう！", "zh": "啊，才刚开始小茜就差点暴走了！？莉绪小姐，怎么办啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "ec658210d0e209ea68056d55af72ac28856065e89653574124e1ae90bfec11fa", "ja": "そうねえ、やる気があるのはいいんだけど……。\nビジネスチャンスの前に、アイドルなのよねぇ。", "zh": "是啊，有干劲是好事，不过……\n在抓住商机之前，先记住自己是偶像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "1c19305a77e6831db5fa01febd0d49ccfb633dc59493642ff35062c931fd174e", "ja": "{$P$}くん以外で、\n茜ちゃんの手綱を締められる人っていうと……。", "zh": "除了{$P$}先生之外，要说能管住小茜的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1029_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b7af52b1af9b35e7b9d2e0002c8fdabbfb2c20070bd559b6c8d7661f6e1bee4", "ja": "あっ。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "2a19400fa7aad521db9a469acfc4fad1da91db4b2deb26697dfec7878cb5dbd1", "ja": "ナイスタイミング！", "zh": "时机正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "4ba5fb662fbda81c13746487754856dab8e69bc3fc69b54d249c2a53128a4bec", "ja": "あっ、いた！　茜！！", "zh": "啊，找到了！茜！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "9871d653b50450d452358174f2230015e891f995477440cd6c8764377c890985", "ja": "ニャッ！？　りりり、律子さん！？", "zh": "喵！？律律律、律子小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "051efdfc35963bb9c16fdf20bc1916c6c8c52a43eb171a71022b93a56bf96f7c", "ja": "探したわよ！　茜、また事務所に内緒で、\n新しい茜ちゃん人形を大量発注しようとしてたわね！？", "zh": "找到你了！茜，你又想瞒着事务所，大量订购新的小茜玩偶了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "4c9a36bab9dfa8fcddb3914d488379407db509d2cc6aea8cf268e47cf07b9df6", "ja": "ぎくっ！？　……な、なんのことかニャ！？\nき、記憶にゴザイマセン……。", "zh": "咯噔！？……什、什么事喵！？  \n我、我不记得有这回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1036_009rit", "source_sha256": "a367646d6811cde6bdde106462cac6ab03bfd60c086a581892cbe131a7aa5759", "ja": "しらばっくれても無駄よ。ここに発注書という、\n動かぬ証拠があるんですからね！", "zh": "装傻也没用。因为这里有订货单这一铁证！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "f72cafa0c615903d2df1e0d84b84b3e3bc3cb0b11930817e48dec015039069df", "ja": "ギクギクッ。いや……今は、次の\n大事なお仕事の打ち合わせ中だから……ね！？", "zh": "咯噔咯噔。那个……现在正在商谈接下来的重要工作……对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "6ad94e13ada00d4ac168070d53a60c4d11c7ece040ccc34fd6dc859c1a12f493", "ja": "それならさっき、{$P$}と廊下で\n擦れ違ったわよ。「終わったから大丈夫」ですって。", "zh": "那样的话，我刚才在走廊上和{$P$}擦肩而过哦。\n他说：“已经结束了，没事。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "8b22623ec7ab671074980c1e6a5b791d648ad74e45f9b73df98f549f68816151", "ja": "ギニャー！？\n{$P$}ちゃんめ……！", "zh": "呜喵——！？\n{$P$}这家伙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1040_009rit", "source_sha256": "add2f4059aed7f6d2a59f90db451c718bf5da26ddde24c1750b12aa42c9f29b0", "ja": "そういうわけで、茜のこと、\nすこし借りてもいいですか？", "zh": "所以，可以借用一下茜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "0b8bf93d02852fd6564efc81dc81e5d7fe8a2f55baa3d38ad60334f7a96f1209", "ja": "ええ、大丈夫よ律子ちゃん。", "zh": "嗯，没问题，律子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d60e9451f9ad0e70939f48098caf8a4372a231eae96c7ad133e0fb4838cf5c7e", "ja": "私たちも、茜ちゃんには、\nお仕事に集中してもらいたいし……。", "zh": "我们也希望小茜能专心工作……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "a2e6abd5efb7d0a621e0bfa1397abd8e9b25d997120dc66a15eee0269ad9e23c", "ja": "茜ちゃん、いってらっしゃい！\nアンバサダー、みんなでがんばろうね！", "zh": "小茜，路上小心！\n大家一起努力当好大使吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "5a5db8c47ad719ddb615dfeae2f17d707b8f255baaa6bf27d2a7163795126b8f", "ja": "ギニャーーーー！！？", "zh": "吉喵————！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1045_023aka", "source_sha256": "1f9e5264d53e1b866b15fc8ac328462d6ae7b9254a2106a0a13391f95b9abc15", "ja": "（……そう。このときの茜ちゃんは、\nまだ知らなかったのです）", "zh": "（……没错。那时候的小茜还不知道）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_01_1046_023aka", "source_sha256": "d147d2bde1fa536c64ba6a8985fa615db91003b85eed4b16c563610299a4f915", "ja": "（茜ちゃんはもう、ハロウィンの悪夢の\n入り口に立っていたのだということを……）", "zh": "（小茜已经站在万圣节噩梦的入口了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
